<Defs>

	<ThingDef ParentName="DrugImplantThingMakeableBase">
		<defName>DI_BeerImplant</defName>
		<label>drug-implant (Beer)</label>
		<description>A synthesizer, encoded to produce Beer from nutrients the user eats. The user will need to eat more to sustain themselves as a consequence. The brain requires time to neurologically adapt to the constant presence of the drug, causing complications until the brain has adapted.

Once adapted, the synthesizer consistently releases small traces of Beer into the bloodstream, which helps to ease tension a little, without negatively impacting the user. Upon the user losing consciousness from any source, however, the implant will release higher doses of Beer into the bloodstream, which helps the user to better ignore pain. This does have the beneficial side effect of making the user calmer. The user gains increased pain tolerance and improves mood when losing Consciousness.</description>
		<descriptionHyperlinks>
			<RecipeDef>InstallDI_BeerImplant</RecipeDef>
		</descriptionHyperlinks>
		<techLevel>Spacer</techLevel>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>Things/Item/Health/HealthItem</texPath>
			<graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
			<drawSize>0.80</drawSize>
			<color>(189,169,118)</color>
		</graphicData>
		<statBases>
			<MarketValue>400</MarketValue>
		</statBases>
		<costList>
			<Beer>10</Beer>
			<DI_BaseImplantPart>1</DI_BaseImplantPart>
		</costList>
		<recipeMaker>
			<recipeUsers Inherit="False">
				<li>DrugLab</li>
			</recipeUsers>
			<researchPrerequisites>
				<li>Brewing</li>
			</researchPrerequisites>
		</recipeMaker>
		<thingCategories>
			<li>BodyParts</li>
		</thingCategories>
	</ThingDef>
	
